Note on content: the transcripts are logs of real working sessions. Personal data has
been replaced with stable pseudonyms and credentials have been redacted, but the logs
are published as records, not as advice, and nothing in them is a warranty of
correctness. See README.md for how selection and scrubbing work, and for what the
automated gate explicitly cannot judge.
